        "revision": "r2-fd567658740f",
        "parent": "r1-4d2baeb1ffda",
        "description": "Still zellige mosaic: eightfold cobalt rosettes, ivory tesserae and saffron accents",
        "source": "# Still zellige: all geometry and glaze depend only on position.\n# Fold a point into one of eight mirrored wedges.\n: wedge\n  polar >pol\n  <pol y 0.392699 + 0.785398 mod 0.392699 - abs\n  <pol x swap vec2 cart\n;\n# Signed edge of an eight-point star, with straight ceramic edges.\n: star\n  wedge dup x swap y 1.45 * + 0.465 - 1.7614 /\n;\n# Octagonal distance for the central white medallion.\n: octagon\n  abs >a\n  <a x <a y max\n  <a x <a y + 0.707107 * max\n;\n# Four by four repeating rosettes.\nuv 4 * >grid\n<grid fract 0.5 - >q\n<q star >edge\n<q wedge >fold\n<q octagon 0.132 - >hub\n# Alternating cobalt facets, warm white ground, tiny saffron corner diamonds.\n[0.88,0.87,0.81,1] >ivory\n[0.018,0.055,0.30,1] [0.027,0.10,0.44,1]\n<q polar y 0.392699 + 0.785398 / floor 2 mod mix >cobalt\n<ivory <cobalt -0.0015 0.0015 <edge smoothstep 1- mix\n<ivory -0.0015 0.0015 <hub smoothstep 1- mix\n>ceramic\n# A small saffron diamond sits at each junction of four repeats.\n<q abs 0.5 swap - x+y 0.105 - 0.707107 * >goldedge\n<ceramic [0.86,0.43,0.035,1] -0.0015 0.0015 <goldedge smoothstep 1- mix\n>ceramic\n# Saffron centre jewel, deliberately much smaller than the cobalt petals.\n<q abs x+y 0.045 - 0.707107 * >jewel\n<ceramic [0.86,0.43,0.035,1] -0.0015 0.0015 <jewel smoothstep 1- mix\n>ceramic\n# Grout follows star edges, hub, centre jewels and the eight petal divisions.\n<edge abs <hub abs min <goldedge abs min <jewel abs min >joint\n<fold x 0.382683 * <fold y 0.92388 * - abs\n<hub 0.004 > * <hub 0.004 <= 1 * +\n<joint min >joint\n# Straight background joints end at the rosette and corner diamonds.\n<q abs dup x swap y max 0.5 swap -\n<edge 0.006 > * <edge 0.006 <= 1 * +\n<joint min >joint\n# Subtle static glaze variation; dark, narrow recessed mortar.\n<ceramic uv 95 * noise 0.045 * 0.955 + *\n>glaze\n[0.024,0.028,0.035,1] <glaze 0.003 0.005 <joint smoothstep mix\n",
